Chapter: HalFlashLeak
  cites Foreword chapter Board

 A flash bank that is never sealed is not a leaked handle. It is a live
 write path into the running firmware, left unlocked with nobody owning
 it -- the next stray store lands in the image the machine boots.

 The bank is linear, so dropping it is CDX2063.

Section: Body
  leak : Integer -> [Flash, Device.Mmio] Integer
  leak (base) = act
    b <- flash-open-bank base
    mmio-read-32 base
  end

  opening : Text = "leak"
